  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">El Houda Livestock Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to improve the functioning of a well to satisfy the water demandof animals; as well as irrigate an existing market garden for vegetable production. The Cooperative will be able to manage a working capital fund to purchase livestock feed and veterinary products.</narrative>
  </description>
